The feature lifting is valid under the stated recovery and independent-cost assumptions. The Heuberger attribution repair is correct, and Huang’s Theorem 4.4 makes the quantifier error described in the ledger. The dossier also qualifies its status carefully: Section 8e is unresolved here, but the available sources do not certify that exact formulation as still open across the literature.
